Z||000006||kslish||12-30-2001||02:47 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by The Fieromaster:<BR><B>I just want THAT issue.. but not even the BOOKSTORES around here have Performance Pontiac Magazine... How do i get it!?!?<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, the full name of the mag is "High Performance Pontiac" and I can usually find it at Wal-Mart or the local Barnes & Noble bookstore.  I started looking for that issue last week but the places around here still have the Feb. issue out.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  <P>This is what the cover looks like that you'll be looking for:  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.highperformancepontiac.com/covers/hpp/0302.jpg"> <P>Full table of contents available at: <BR> <A HREF="http://www.highperformancepontiac.com/archives/toc/toc0302.jsp" TARGET=_blank>http://www.highperformancepontiac.com/archives/toc/toc0302.jsp</A> <P>Ken S.||||reg||1
