Z||000011||lildevil||12-30-2001||11:26 PM||||Its jus now got on the newstands here in my area so keep looking.  As for the weight issue...thats what  Fieros weigh. Even stock Fieros are in the 2800-3000 lb range.  They are not lightweights like many outsiders believe.  As for the driving lights....thanks for noticing.  Lots of cutting and glueing went into that job. I hope to have my website up and running soon. Now my biggest problem is that i want to do some changes to the car they next few months but i am afraid if i do people won't recognize it from the magazine. Decisions, Decisions<P>------------------<BR>Earl Sessions<BR>1985 Fiero w/ 1998 Supercharged 3.8 V-6<BR>Best ET: 13.232 @ 101.24 mph<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/water3quarterthumb.jpg"> ||||reg||1
